A||N||22||CFOG-I||Announcement......!!||||1||
Z||000000||CFOG-I||09-22-2001||01:49 AM||||Classic Fiero Owners Group International (CFOG-I) is a global organization committed to inform and enlighten Fiero owners worldwide. We have put together an organization, which will truly be a "members" club -- not only accountable to, but accessible to its members. With member benefits such as a toll-free technical "hotline", group automobile insurance coverage, and additional member and club incentives, Classic Fiero Owners Group International is available for clubs and individuals alike........<P>We recognize the fact that organizations of this magnitude have been attempted before and we have taken a good look at the success and failures of the groups preceding this one. We believe that we have put policies and procedures in place to assure our success and are employing people highly knowledgeable of the Fiero and, any and all of them are there for your assistance. This is not an attempt at replacing any other organization but rather to offer the Fiero owners and clubs an alternative.........<P>We also recognize the fact that there are individuals who have the desire to start clubs in their area and we are here with assistance for them to accomplish that task, from a "club starter package" containing how to start a club to a web site design package for clubs, Classic Fiero Owners Group International is there for the member........we are also in the process of producing a "club introduction package" for individuals who are already members of a club to present to their clubs in the event they wish to join in this organization.<P>We invite you to take a look at the club web site at  <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog-i.org</A>  and join with us as we grow in this new and exciting venture..........Regional Director and Deputy Director positions may be available in your area. If interested, call Classic Fiero Owners Group International, toll free, at 866-FIERO GT (343-7648).<P>Terry Owens<BR>Chairman<BR>Classic Fiero Owners Group International<BR><p>[This message has been edited by CFOG-I (edited 09-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||87ECO5||09-22-2001||08:01 AM||||Awesome!  How can I join the ... oh wait ... I'm already a member!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Looking forward to some exciting months ahead ...||||reg||6
Z||000002||Sage||09-22-2001||09:48 AM||||Sounds very interesting.<P>Please keep us posted with updates on development and progress.<P>Have a good one!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||6
Z||000003||MinnGreenGT||09-22-2001||09:52 AM||||Sage- Check out the website <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cfog-i.org</A>   there is quite a bit on info already on there.  Terry- Glad to see the debut this weekend!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole.gif">  <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
Z||000004||2xsess||09-22-2001||11:13 AM||||Sweet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Terry, I sent you an email. I would call but that's impossible from over here. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>kresge1975@yahoo.com<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">           <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||6
Z||000005||fieroshop||09-22-2001||01:45 PM||||What a great idea, an idea that time has come for it's excistance. Hope to see every join and make this the best club in the world.<BR>I joined and payed my dues. <BR>Come on gang......This will be for the betterment of our beloved Fiero's, a way to help all Fiero Owners and more shows to show our little cars.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
